Title: Salty
Artist: Kenny Baker
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Notes: Form is AABACCBA. Chords differ with other internet sources but I'm pretty confident these are correct. Some sources indicate diminished chords in the song. I think there might be some diminished behavior with the lead note choices but there are no actual diminished chords.
---
A:
I       | I       | I     | I vi   |
I       | IV      | V     | I      |

B:
III     | III     | VI    | VI     |
II      | II      | V     | V      |

C:
I       | bVII    | I     | bVII   |
I bVII  | I bVII  | I V   | I      |
